abstract: >-
  Python implementation, Colab notebooks and exported data for a minimal dynamical model of a
  periodontal site in which the host response threshold is a slowly recovering adaptive state.
  The model shows post-therapy vulnerability, memory ratchets under periodic plaque removal and
  structural memory through attachment loss.
preferred-citation:
